# Roles and Responsibilities

## CEO

- Approves Information Security Program
- Provides funding

## CISO

- Owns the ISMS
- Performs Risk Assessment
- Reports Security Metrics

## IT Team

- Manage Infrastructure
- Patch Systems
- Manage Backups

## Engineering

- Secure Software Development
- Fix Vulnerabilities

## Customer Success

- Handle Customer Security Requests
- Support Audit Evidence Collection

## Human Resources

- Employee Onboarding
- Employee Offboarding
- Security Awareness Training

## Employees

- Follow Security Policies
- Report Security Incidents

